        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fantastical world reminiscent of Gion, with its rows of Japanese-style streets, in this exploration horror game reminiscent of the “Exit 8” series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players uncover lurking “anomalies” while drawing closer to the truth hidden behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you discern all the abnormalities lurking within this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV：chunchunkoyagi</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days that should remain unchanged. Then why am I here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fox causing the anomalies, and the supernatural beings who abhor change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in this world with no allies, the chosen one—me—must pursue the mystery through prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress centers on discovering anomalies and praying with offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirming discovered anomalies advances the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making offerings unlocks new anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 30+ types of anomalies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We especially hope those who feel a certain dullness in their daily lives will play this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Videos &amp; Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are highly encouraged! We'd be thrilled if you shared your impressions on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Request from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an independent production by an amateur high school student. There may be areas of inexperience or bugs, but we'd be grateful if you could enjoy it with a kind eye.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fantastical world reminiscent of Gion, with its rows of Japanese-style streets, in this exploration horror game reminiscent of the “Exit 8” series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players uncover lurking “anomalies” while drawing closer to the truth hidden behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you discern all the abnormalities lurking within this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV：chunchunkoyagi</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days that should remain unchanged. Then why am I here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fox causing the anomalies, and the supernatural beings who abhor change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in this world with no allies, the chosen one—me—must pursue the mystery through prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress centers on discovering anomalies and praying with offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirming discovered anomalies advances the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making offerings unlocks new anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 30+ types of anomalies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We especially hope those who feel a certain dullness in their daily lives will play this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Videos &amp; Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are highly encouraged! We'd be thrilled if you shared your impressions on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Request from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an independent production by an amateur high school student. There may be areas of inexperience or bugs, but we'd be grateful if you could enjoy it with a kind eye.</p>",
        "short_description": "Set against the backdrop of a Japanese-style townscape reminiscent of Gion, this exploration-based horror game involves searching for “anomalies” and offering prayers. A work dedicated to those who feel bored with their daily lives.",
